messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/addtiffo/tif_overview.c
Line: 848
Function: TIFFBuildOverviews
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: _TIFFmalloc results for panRed2/panGreen2/panBlue2 are not checked for NULL before memcpy. If allocation fails, memcpy to a NULL destination at lines 848-850 will dereference NULL.

Source context:
```c
